2026-07-05 13:10:26 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-07-05 13:10:26 [grok-build-0.1] // CGKeyCode values
2026-07-05 13:10:26 [grok-build-0.1] const kVK_LeftArrow  = 0x7b;
