2026-07-05 13:10:26 [grok-build-0.1] Notes
2026-07-05 13:10:26 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-07-05 13:10:26 [grok-build-0.1] - Matches the exact bit layout used by `grid.ts` and `centipede.ts`:
2026-07-05 13:10:26 [grok-build-0.1]   - `1` = up
2026-07-05 13:10:26 [grok-build-0.1]   - `2` = down
