2026-07-07 21:00:45 [grok-build-0.1] • Critical bug: Labels are broken*
2026-07-07 21:00:45 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-07-07 21:00:45 [grok-build-0.1] In `machine.ts`:
2026-07-07 21:00:45 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-07-07 21:00:45 [grok-build-0.1] this.labels = new Map<string, string>();
2026-07-07 21:00:45 [grok-build-0.1] ...
