2026-07-09 18:29:36 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-07-09 18:29:36 [grok-build-0.1] • A. Consider extracting flag logic*
2026-07-09 18:29:36 [grok-build-0.1] Something like this would clean up a lot of the opcodes:
2026-07-09 18:29:36 [grok-build-0.1] 
