2026-07-09 18:48:38 [grok-build-0.1] `0x40` is the Return from Interrupt instruction.
2026-07-09 18:48:38 [grok-build-0.1] 
2026-07-09 18:48:38 [grok-build-0.1] Add this case to your `switch` (place it near the `0x60` RTS case):
