2026-07-09 18:51:26 [grok-build-0.1] - Store the shifted value back to memory
2026-07-09 18:51:26 [grok-build-0.1] - Update N/Z flags from the final A, C from the shift
2026-07-09 18:51:26 [grok-build-0.1] 
