2026-07-12 19:31:38 [gpt-5.6-terra] Thanks for sharing this. It is a substantial, hands-on 6502/Atari machine implementation: ROM
2026-07-12 19:31:38 [gpt-5.6-terra] loading, a partial CPU interpreter, input-mapped I/O, VBLANK IRQ handling, and an early DVG
2026-07-12 19:31:38 [gpt-5.6-terra] interpreter are all present.
2026-07-12 19:31:38 [gpt-5.6-terra] 
2026-07-12 19:31:38 [gpt-5.6-terra] A few notable review points:
2026-07-12 19:31:38 [gpt-5.6-terra] 
