2026-07-12 19:31:38 [gpt-5.6-terra] - DVG protection: DVG call-stack underflow/overflow and malformed vector lists are not
2026-07-12 19:31:38 [gpt-5.6-terra] guarded, although the overall instruction-count ceiling is a useful safety measure.
2026-07-12 19:31:38 [gpt-5.6-terra] 
