2026-07-12 19:31:38 [gpt-5.6-terra] 
2026-07-12 19:31:38 [gpt-5.6-terra] The instruction coverage is already fairly broad for the listed games, and the centralized status
2026-07-12 19:31:38 [gpt-5.6-terra] helpers (`setStatus`, `setCarry`, `setOverflow`, `adc`, `sbc`) are a good foundation.
