2026-07-13 21:34:23 [gpt-5.6-terra] It consumes the following padding byte, pushes `PC + 2`, pushes status with the B flag set, sets I,
2026-07-13 21:34:23 [gpt-5.6-terra] then jumps through the IRQ/BRK vector at `FFFE/FFFF`.
