2026-07-16 19:06:33 [simon@midnightblue.local] escape code to hide cursor
2026-07-16 19:06:38 [deepseek-v4-flash] 🟠nitrologic Relay 1.9.5 deepseek-v4-flash 🐋 🪠 0.7° $0.000 506B 4.22s
2026-07-16 19:06:38 [deepseek-v4-flash] The escape sequence to hide the cursor in a terminal that supports ANSI escape codes is:
2026-07-16 19:06:38 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-07-16 19:06:38 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-07-16 19:06:38 [deepseek-v4-flash] \033[?25l
2026-07-16 19:06:38 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-07-16 19:06:38 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-07-16 19:06:38 [deepseek-v4-flash] To show it again:
2026-07-16 19:06:38 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-07-16 19:06:38 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-07-16 19:06:38 [deepseek-v4-flash] \033[?25h
2026-07-16 19:06:38 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-07-16 19:06:38 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-07-16 19:06:38 [deepseek-v4-flash] Below is a minimal example in Python that hides the cursor for the duration of a program and
2026-07-16 19:06:38 [deepseek-v4-flash] restores it upon exit:
2026-07-16 19:06:38 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-07-16 19:06:38 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-07-16 19:06:38 [deepseek-v4-flash] import sys
2026-07-16 19:06:38 [deepseek-v4-flash] import time
2026-07-16 19:06:38 [deepseek-v4-flash] import atexit
2026-07-16 19:06:38 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-07-16 19:06:38 [deepseek-v4-flash] def hide_cursor():
2026-07-16 19:06:38 [deepseek-v4-flash]     sys.stdout.write("\033[?25l")
2026-07-16 19:06:38 [deepseek-v4-flash]     sys.stdout.flush()
2026-07-16 19:06:38 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-07-16 19:06:38 [deepseek-v4-flash] def show_cursor():
2026-07-16 19:06:38 [deepseek-v4-flash]     sys.stdout.write("\033[?25h")
2026-07-16 19:06:38 [deepseek-v4-flash]     sys.stdout.flush()
2026-07-16 19:06:38 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-07-16 19:06:38 [deepseek-v4-flash] # Automatically show cursor when program exits
2026-07-16 19:06:38 [deepseek-v4-flash] atexit.register(show_cursor)
2026-07-16 19:06:38 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-07-16 19:06:38 [deepseek-v4-flash] hide_cursor()
2026-07-16 19:06:38 [deepseek-v4-flash] print("Cursor is now hidden. Wait 3 seconds...")
2026-07-16 19:06:38 [deepseek-v4-flash] time.sleep(3)
2026-07-16 19:06:38 [deepseek-v4-flash] show_cursor()
2026-07-16 19:06:38 [deepseek-v4-flash] print("Cursor is visible again.")
2026-07-16 19:06:38 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-07-16 19:06:38 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
