2026-07-16 19:11:10 [deepseek-v4-flash] code 8 (decimal), which is the control-H character (BS – backspace). In Applesoft BASIC,
2026-07-16 19:11:10 [deepseek-v4-flash] you can detect it with something like:
2026-07-16 19:11:10 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-07-16 19:11:10 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
