2026-07-16 19:11:10 [deepseek-v4-flash] 20 IF K = 140 THEN PRINT "BACKSPACE" : REM 140 = 8 + 128 (high bit set)
2026-07-16 19:11:10 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-07-16 19:11:10 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-07-16 19:11:10 [deepseek-v4-flash] or simply check for `K = 8` after clearing the high bit.
