2026-07-16 19:22:17 [deepseek-v4-flash] expects `Delete` (keycode `7F`) to erase the last character, while `Backspace` (`08`) is treated as
2026-07-16 19:22:17 [deepseek-v4-flash] a literal control character that prints a glyph (e.g., a small square).
