2026-07-16 19:23:25 [deepseek-v4-flash] monitor expects DEL (0x7F) to erase the previous character and move the cursor back.
2026-07-16 19:23:25 [deepseek-v4-flash] Sending BS (0x08) just prints a weird glyph.
2026-07-16 19:23:25 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
