2026-07-16 19:23:25 [deepseek-v4-flash] almost all terminals send 127 for Backspace.)
2026-07-16 19:23:25 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-07-16 19:23:25 [deepseek-v4-flash] After this change, pressing Backspace will send $7F to the Apple II, and the monitor (and many
2026-07-16 19:23:25 [deepseek-v4-flash] programs) will erase characters correctly.
2026-07-16 19:23:25 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-07-16 19:23:25 [deepseek-v4-flash] If you also want to handle the actual Backspace key (e.g., on a Mac’s `Fn+Delete`), you can add a
