2026-07-16 19:34:05 [deepseek-v4-flash] The Apple II character code for `#` is 0x23 (35 decimal). This is the same as standard
2026-07-16 19:34:05 [deepseek-v4-flash] ASCII.
2026-07-16 19:34:05 [deepseek-v4-flash] If you want it displayed normally (not inverse), pass it with bit 7 clear (i.e., `0x23`). If you
2026-07-16 19:34:05 [deepseek-v4-flash] want inverse `#`, use `0xA3` (with bit 7 set).
