2026-07-24 17:00:03 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-07-24 17:00:03 [deepseek-v4-flash] ## Input / Output
2026-07-24 17:00:03 [deepseek-v4-flash] - PRINT – Output text or values to the screen.
2026-07-24 17:00:03 [deepseek-v4-flash] - INPUT – Read a value from the keyboard.
2026-07-24 17:00:03 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-07-24 17:00:03 [deepseek-v4-flash] ## Variable Assignment
2026-07-24 17:00:03 [deepseek-v4-flash] - LET – Assign a value to a variable.
2026-07-24 17:00:03 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-07-24 17:00:03 [deepseek-v4-flash] ## Program Flow
2026-07-24 17:00:03 [deepseek-v4-flash] - IF … THEN – Conditional execution.
2026-07-24 17:00:03 [deepseek-v4-flash] - FOR … NEXT – Create a counting loop.
2026-07-24 17:00:03 [deepseek-v4-flash] - GOSUB … RETURN – Branch to a subroutine and return.
2026-07-24 17:00:03 [deepseek-v4-flash] - GOTO – Unconditional jump to a line number.
2026-07-24 17:00:03 [deepseek-v4-flash] - END – Terminate program execution.
2026-07-24 17:00:03 [deepseek-v4-flash] - STOP – Halt execution (similar to END, but often used for debugging).
2026-07-24 17:00:03 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
2026-07-24 17:00:03 [deepseek-v4-flash] ## Documentation
2026-07-24 17:00:03 [deepseek-v4-flash] - REM – Insert a remark (ignored during execution).
2026-07-24 17:00:03 [deepseek-v4-flash] 
