2026-07-24 17:00:03 [deepseek-v4-flash] ## Graphics
2026-07-24 17:00:03 [deepseek-v4-flash] *None (Integer BASIC has no graphics commands; see Applesoft BASIC for HGR, HPLOT, etc.)*
