2026-07-24 17:18:48 [kimi-k3] So a "1977 manual" for Integer BASIC would be an Apple II document. The relevant one is
2026-07-24 17:18:48 [kimi-k3] usually cited as the Apple II BASIC Programming Manual (1977) — it covers Integer BASIC as
2026-07-24 17:18:48 [kimi-k3] shipped on the Apple II, including the graphics commands we discussed.
2026-07-24 17:18:48 [kimi-k3] 
