2026-07-24 17:18:48 [kimi-k3] 
2026-07-24 17:18:48 [kimi-k3] - Apple II = 1977, Apple I = 1976. Solid.
2026-07-24 17:18:48 [kimi-k3] - The early Apple II programming manual documented Integer BASIC, since Applesoft didn't arrive
2026-07-24 17:18:48 [kimi-k3] until 1978 (on cassette, then in ROM with the II Plus). Solid.
2026-07-24 17:18:48 [kimi-k3] - So: yes, a 1977 Integer BASIC manual is Apple II material.
2026-07-24 17:18:48 [kimi-k3] 
