2026-07-24 17:18:48 [kimi-k3] Manual or similar phrasing, and there were also the "Red Book" (the January 1978 Apple II
2026-07-24 17:18:48 [kimi-k3] Reference Manual, often called the red book) which contains the Integer BASIC monitor/ROM
2026-07-24 17:18:48 [kimi-k3] details.
2026-07-24 17:18:48 [kimi-k3] 
