2026-07-24 20:02:57 [kimi-k3] `Ctrl-B` from... hmm, actually the Autostart ROM doesn't have the `` Monitor workflow at all in
2026-07-24 20:02:57 [kimi-k3] the same way. If you genuinely got `*` → Ctrl-B → `>` with Integer BASIC semantics (`PRINT 3/2` =
