2026-07-24 20:16:56 [kimi-k3] `C052`/`C053` are actually the mixed-mode switches (full graphics vs 4-line text window);
2026-07-24 20:16:56 [kimi-k3] page select is `C054`/`C055`. Also `C053` itself is missing from the switch — add it.
