2026-07-24 20:35:05 [kimi-k3] — worth deleting to avoid confusion, along with the stale `TODO: split mode` comment above it,
2026-07-24 20:35:05 [kimi-k3] since mixed mode is now implemented.
2026-07-24 20:35:05 [kimi-k3] 
